  "centroid_northing": 190997,
  "actual_completion_date": null,
  "cil_liability": null,
  "subdivision_of_building": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The proposed use would have an unacceptable impact to the amenity of neighbouring\r\noccupiers in terms of disturbance, noise, and potential odours caused by the creation\r\nof a commercial car-wash in a residential setting, and due to a sense of\r\nenclosure and overbearing development created by the proposed structures along\r\nthe boundary of 205 Wadham Road, as such the proposal is contrary to policy 57 of\r\nLP1 (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;Insufficient\r\ninformation has been provided for the Local Planning Authority to make a thorough\r\nassessment with regards to trip generation, traffic and pedestrian safety, and\r\ndisturbance to the surrounding roads and therefore without further information\r\nto suggest otherwise, the proposed development would be unacceptable due to its\r\nhighways, traffic generation, highway network and pedestrian safety impact\r\nwhich is contrary to Policy 63 of Waltham Forests LP1 (2024), T2 and T4 of the\r\nLondon Plan (2021).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot; xml:lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; class=&quot;TextRun SCXW144569348 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 18.3458px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;&quot;&gt;In principle, the accessibility and ability for National Grid to maintain/repair and to have access to the power cables, while guaranteeing power supply is a material planning consideration and therefore, it is concluded that development on the site is unacceptable in principle as would impede the ability to have access to the power cables. Furthermore, due to the nature of the use and with a lack of regard, or information about safety and maintenance to the cables, as such it would be contrary to Policies 6 (Ensuring Good Growth) and Policy 70 (utilities and infrastructure) of LP1 (2024), London Plan policies GG6 Increasing Efficiency and Resilience and D11 Safety, Security and Resilience which all seek to ensure that developments retain and protect infrastructure and for developments to have an acceptable impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW144569348 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 18.3458px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:\r\nEN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The proposed\r\ndevelopment fails to have proper regard to the potential environmental impacts\r\nof the development by way of drainage, noise and air pollution. &amp;nbsp;This is due to the present surface water\r\ndrainage issues and use which would increase water flows onsite, the proposed loud\r\nmachinery onsite in close proximity to residential dwellings, and the use which\r\nwould increase vehicle presence on site, and the failure submit a sustainable\r\nurban drainage assessment, a noise report, or a air quality assessment for\r\nthese matters. It is therefore not clear how the proposed use would properly\r\ndeal with these environmental considerations &amp;nbsp;and the proposed development under current\r\ninformation is considered to cause environmental harm to the immediate locality\r\nwhich would not be not supported by Policies 50, 88 and 91 of Waltham Forests\r\nLP1 (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot; xml:lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; class=&quot;TextRun SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 18.3458px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: none !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;&quot;&gt;In principle, the accessibility and ability for National Grid to maintain/repair and to have access to the power cables, while guaranteeing power supply is a material planning consideration and therefore, it is concluded that development on the site is unacceptable in principle as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;&quot;&gt;it &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;&quot;&gt;would impede the ability to have access to the power cables. Furthermore, due to the nature of the use and with a lack of regard, or information about safety &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;&quot;&gt;of the cables &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;&quot;&gt;and proper drainage, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;&quot;&gt;the submission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text;&quot;&gt; contrary to Policies 6 (Ensuring Good Growth) and Policy 70 (utilities and infrastructure) of LP1 (2024), London Plan policies GG6 Increasing Efficiency and Resilience and D11 Safety, Security and Resilience which all seek to ensure that developments retain and protect infrastructure and for developments to have an acceptable impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW214829872 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot; style=&quot;-webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 18.3458px; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
